 "remarks": "Welcome to River Haven! This bright and inviting 1-bedroom, 1-bath ranch-style co-op offers 750 square feet of comfortable, easy living in a convenient Stamford location. Clean, neat, and move-in ready, this well-maintained unit features updated flooring throughout, updated appliances, and an abundance of natural light streaming through its generously sized windows. The functional floor plan offers a spacious living area, a comfortable bedroom, and a welcoming atmosphere. Additional features include a ceiling fan and window air-conditioning units for added comfort. River Haven is an established, owner-occupied co-op community offering on-site laundry, resident parking, EV charging stations, and outdoor common areas. Monthly association fees include heat, hot water, cooking gas, sewer, and property taxes, providing exceptional value and convenience. Ideally situated in a residential neighborhood just minutes from Downtown Stamford, Scalzi Park, Mill River Park, Stamford Hospital, UConn Stamford, shopping, restaurants, entertainment, and Metro-North transportation. Easy access to I-95 and the Merritt Parkway makes commuting a breeze. A fantastic opportunity for first-time buyers, downsizers, or anyone seeking affordable, low-maintenance living in the heart of Stamford. Owner occupancy only; no investors. Don't miss this opportunity to make River Haven your new home!",
